 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516548,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Mina’s family has replaced 65% of their home’s older light bulbs with LED bulbs. If they now have 52 LED bulbs, how many total lightbulbs are in Mina’s house?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The formula relating the total (base), the percent in decimal form, and the part (amount) is</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = percent \\times total\"></span>.</p>\n<p>52 is 65% of the total.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"52 = 0.65 \\times total\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{52}}{{0.65}} = \\frac{{\\cancel{{.0.65}} \\times total}}{{\\cancel{{0.65}}}}\"></span></p>\n<p>The total is 80 bulbs.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "80 bulbs."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
